Subject: [PATCH 21/39] Parse m3u attribute lists with quoted values

The attributes were split at every ',', also inside quoted values
like CODECS="avc1,mp4a" or a NAME with a comma, and the values were
cut at fixed offsets.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
